I brought a sport coat with me

00:29:44.790 --> 00:29:46.610
and Brent happened to bring one too

00:29:46.610 --> 00:29:48.280
and we're like why don't
we have a interview

00:29:48.280 --> 00:29:49.113
with each other.

00:29:49.113 --> 00:29:49.946
You just won $2 billion

00:29:49.946 --> 00:29:51.350
against Monsanto that'll be interesting.

00:29:51.350 --> 00:29:53.300
And yeah, I love my Indochino suites.

